notes: "1.7B and 0.6B variants, both Apache-2.0 and ungated. The 1.7B is 2.04 B
  parameters whole with a 1024-wide, 24-layer audio encoder at 128 mel bins. Released
  2026-01-28, which is NEWER than Qwen3-VL-8B (2025-10-11) and Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B
  (2025-09-20). Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B is the alignment companion."
